WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.205
Muso dɔw tɔgɔw be tɛmɛ wagati bɛɛ kan.

00:00:03.285 --> 00:00:09.084
Bobo Dioulasso dugu la, Guimbi Ouattara ka koo bele be to ka kɛ ten.

00:00:09.164 --> 00:00:15.135
Walisa k'a ka maana faamu, an ka kan ka kɔsegi saan kɛmɛkulu 19nan na.

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:18.939
O wagati la, dugu tɔgɔ wɛrɛ tun be yen: Sya.

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:22.138
Guimbi bɔra Ouattara, Dioula mara la.

00:00:22.218 --> 00:00:27.671
A fɔra yen ko u faaw bɔra Kong mara la, Côte d'Ivoire jamana na.

00:00:27.751 --> 00:00:32.771
O yɔrɔ la, u tun be lɔyɔrɔba sɔrɔ politikiko ni jagokow la.

00:00:32.851 --> 00:00:41.589
Mɔgɔw tun b'a fɔ ko Guimbi tun ye hakilitigi ye, ko a ye mɔgɔbaba ye ani ko a tun be sɔn ka mɔgɔw sɔn.

00:00:41.669 --> 00:00:43.491
O wagati tun ka gwɛlɛ.

00:00:43.571 --> 00:00:51.531
O kama, u tun ka ɲi k'u yɛrɛ tanga kɛlɛw ma ani ka jagokow kɛ walisa ka see sɔrɔ u juguw kan.

00:00:51.611 --> 00:01:06.660
A fɔra ko Guimbi Ouattara y'a jɔyɔrɔba sɔrɔ ka dugu latanga: a tun be se ka mɔgɔ dɔw ladon, ka ladili di kuntigiw ma ani k'a yɛrɛ tanga mɔgɔ wɛrɛw ma minw tun be Sya bagabaga.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:16.170
Saan 1800 wagati laban na, Erɔpu minw tagara bɔ dugu dɔw la, olu fana y'a lakali ko muso tɔgɔba dɔ tun be yen.

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:22.913
A tun be lonanw ladon ka ɲɛ ani a tun b'a seko bɛɛ kɛ k'o dugu ka koow latigɛ.

00:01:22.993 --> 00:01:34.238
Lɔnnikɛlaw bele be sɔsɔli kɛra a ka setigiya koo la: yala a tun ye masamuso ye tiɲɛn na wa, wala a tun be bonya la mɔgɔ bɛɛ kan wa?

00:01:34.318 --> 00:01:38.647
Tuma dɔw la, mɔgɔ tɛ se k'a latigɛ min ka ɲi ka kɛ.

00:01:38.727 --> 00:01:42.451
Nka, an lanin b'a la ko a hakili be to a la.

00:01:42.531 --> 00:01:51.442
Bobo-Dioulasso dugu la, a tɔgɔ b'a yira ko a jaa ka gwɛlɛ, a ye lonanw ladon ani a tun ye hakilitigi ye.

00:01:51.522 --> 00:02:03.372
A ka maana b'an hakili jigi koo nɔgɔman dɔ la: wagati gwɛlɛw na, muso dɔ sera k'a ka lɔyɔrɔ sigi mɔgɔbabaw cɛma ani ka a ka denbaya tanga.
